### get chats for messages test
# @name getChatsForMessages
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/chats
Authorization: Bearer {{token1}}

### get messages from the first chat
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/chats/b2f675ec-d864-4cc0-94df-4539773e777e/messages?page=1&size=5
Authorization: Bearer {{token1}}

### mark the first chat as read
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/chats/b2f675ec-d864-4cc0-94df-4539773e777e/read
Authorization: Bearer {{token1}}

### get chats
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/chats
Authorization: Bearer {{token2}}